{"date":"2014-01-29","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/e7/aa/95781_9sMQ1.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/e7/aa/95781_9sMQ1.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/e7/aa/95781_9sMQ1.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/e7/aa/95781_9sMQ1.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/e7/aa/95781_9sMQ1.jpg"},"summary":"　　在一片宁静的丛林里，在人类的行迹之下，掩藏着一个生机勃勃、热闹非凡的昆虫世界。一只瓢虫遭遇丛林各色虫类追赶，又闯入红黑蚂蚁的战争现场，亲身见证一场昆虫界的“特洛伊攻城”。影片想象力天马行空，不断抛出新的昆虫物种及各色设计感丰富的道具，在银幕上走马观花，笨拙的蜘蛛、卖萌的瓢虫、精明的蚂蚁，轮番登场，教人目不暇接。整部影片没有对白，以3D形式呈现出昆虫王国的微观世界，动画与实景拍摄结合，创造与好莱坞动画趣味大有不同的法式动画大片。 ","name":"Minuscule : La Vallée des fourmis perdues","name_cn":"昆虫总动员","tags":[{"name":"剧场版","count":34,"total_count":715972},{"name":"欧美","count":27,"total_count":85960},{"name":"法国","count":18,"total_count":3618},{"name":"2014","count":17,"total_count":70595},{"name":"动物","count":8,"total_count":6158},{"name":"昆虫","count":7,"total_count":13},{"name":"原创","count":7,"total_count":610831},{"name":"动画电影","count":6,"total_count":43449},{"name":"非日本动画","count":5,"total_count":59},{"name":"剧场","count":3,"total_count":1897},{"name":"欧洲","count":2,"total_count":470},{"name":"剧场版-02","count":2,"total_count":78},{"name":"补标","count":2,"total_count":2844},{"name":"2010-2019","count":1,"total_count":2166},{"name":"还行","count":1,"total_count":1170},{"name":"待看","count":1,"total_count":525},{"name":"2014年1月","count":1,"total_count":20885},{"name":"欧美动画电影","count":1,"total_count":96},{"name":"1月","count":1,"total_count":1789},{"name":"长片","count":1,"total_count":329},{"name":"动画","count":1,"total_count":35242},{"name":"2010s","count":1,"total_count":5578},{"name":"2013年秋","count":1,"total_count":56},{"name":"2020完成","count":1,"total_count":33},{"name":"电影","count":1,"total_count":13472}],"infobox":[{"key":"中文名","value":"昆虫总动员"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"v":"Minuscule: Valley of the Lost Ants"},{"v":"微观小世界：失落的蚂蚁谷"}]},{"key":"上映年度","value":"2014年1月29日"},{"key":"片长","value":